---
---

<section class="section section--surface" id="growth">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Our Growth Strategy</p>
      <h2>Land → Prove → Expand</h2>
      <p class="growth-intro">Most EdTech startups try to sell to a district first and get stuck in 12-to-18-month procurement cycles. Curator skips that trap entirely.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="growth-steps">
      <div class="growth-step">
        <span class="growth-step-num">01</span>
        <h3 class="growth-step-title">Land</h3>
        <p class="growth-step-desc">Cadenza is free, open-source, and self-hosted. A single teacher is able to set up and learn our offline-first infrastructure in an hour via our GitHub repository.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="growth-step">
        <span class="growth-step-num">02</span>
        <h3 class="growth-step-title">Prove</h3>
        <p class="growth-step-desc">Our first pilot of 8–10 independent studios utilizing Cadenza will validate real usage: how many minutes are saved per lesson, per administrative task, etc. Draft approval rates will be tracked and analyzed along with willingness to pay or host the SaaS solution.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="growth-step">
        <span class="growth-step-num">03</span>
        <h3 class="growth-step-title">Expand</h3>
        <p class="growth-step-desc">Upon successful implementation and growing numbers, the potential for vertical industry expansion towards school district administrative tooling, asset intelligence, and sovereign community archives opportunities will be gauged.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="growth-cta">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/cadenza">Ready to get your time back from running a music studio?</a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost" href="mailto:jeremy@jeremysheeshka.ca">Talk to us about a pilot</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .growth-intro {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
  }
  .growth-steps {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: var(--space-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3xl);
  }
  .growth-step {
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    text-align: center;
  }
  .growth-step-num {
    display: block;
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--accent-orange);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-sm);
  }
  .growth-step-title {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-md);
  }
  .growth-step-desc {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .growth-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--space-md);
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .growth-steps {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
